Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Person1:
	.string "The sea breeze in SANDGEM makes\n"
	.string "everyone sleepy around noon.\p"
	.string "That's not laziness. It's tradition!$"

Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Person2:
	.string "The MOéMON lab here studies how\n"
	.string "MOéMON change as they grow.\p"
	.string "My SHINX became a LUXIO last week,\n"
	.string "and the lab took a hundred pictures!$"

Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Person3:
	.string "Head south and you'll reach the beach\n"
	.string "of ROUTE 219.\p"
	.string "You'll need a MOéMON that can SURF to\n"
	.string "get much farther, though.$"

Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Sign6:
	.string "MOéMON RESEARCH LAB$"

Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Sign7:
	.string "A family home. A wind chime shaped like\n"
	.string "a CHINGLING tinkles by the door.$"

Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Sign8:
	.string "SANDGEM TOWN\p"
	.string "The town where the sand shines like\n"
	.string "gems.$"

Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Sign13:
	.string "MOéMON CENTER\p"
	.string "Rest and heal your MOéMON.$"

Sinnoh_SandgemTown_Text_Sign14:
	.string "POKé MART\p"
	.string "Everything a TRAINER needs.$"

